        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-24T19:32:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That'd be nice - we lost to Dawn earlier mainly 'cause we were really slow starting up - started with Truth in play, then drew Tears in the first turn, then Sweat a turn or two after that while we didn't have massive damage to aim at them since we were the Scholar, Chrono Ranger, and Redeemer Fanatic and kept getting our stuff destroyed (Autumn was out as well though I don't think she ever actually destroyed anything 'cause there was never anything relevant in play by the time she had her turn), which didn't help :P. Had we at least had someone else other than Truth out to start off, we'd've probably done a bit better :P. After he came back for the first time, though, I did succeed in keeping a \"No Executions\" on him so that he stayed at the bottom of the deck for the rest of the game after we killed him again :P.</p>",
