        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koey/{size}/2187_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-25T05:46:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I dont actually have Final Wasteland, but since it says \"When a card would be destroyed\".</p><p>It seems it makes Bunker's Omni Cannon a way to thin his deck and Haka's Savage Mana a way to thin out any cards he can destroy.</p><p>Might be good or bad depending on the card.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I also can see Golem Unity being more useful here since she doesn't have to destroy equipments to deploy bots.</p>",
