        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-17T01:45:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm bringing up this topic to discuss tracking negative hitpoints again.</p><p>So, the ruling is that we do track negative HP. Then, what happens in the following situations?</p><p>1. Fanatic at -5 HP, Wrathful Retribution deals 30-(-5)=35 dmg?</p><p>2. Blade Battalion at -5 HP, Blade Battalion deals -5 dmg?</p><p>3. S-84 Automation Drone, same as Blade Battalion.</p><p>4. Fanatic Final Dives Blade Battalion at -5 HP, then Fanatic deals -5 dmg to another target?</p>",
        "post_number": 78,
        "post_type": 1,
