        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-17T01:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1. That is the way I take it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2-4. Much like if you stun bolt/neurotoxin dart thrower/hoist chain/liquid nitrogen rounds/etc a target more than once, giving them a -2 and they normally would of dealt 1 damage, that damage would be a minus -2, but damage can't be less than 0 so therefore all above mentions would make it a 0.</p>",
