      {
        "id": 55564,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-17T02:04:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>\nbut damage can't be less than 0\n</blockquote>\nhp couldn't be less than zero until recently too, so this may not be a fact to hang your hat on. ;) &nbsp;But at the moment, I agree with your assessment.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I think I will hang my hat on it, because I really don't see villains dealing damage and heroes regaining from it instead. I think that part they will keep their feet firm on the ground for. Otherwise reducing damage just got a lot more broken.</p>",
